| Early Access", "keywords": ["Cooking", "Chef", "Travel", "Food", "Recipes"], "long_description": "# Learn to cook with chefs from around the world!\n\nPractice recipes and learn about different cultures through food. Potluck partners with real chefs from around the globe to bring you hands-on instruction with realistic virtual ingredients and tools.\n\n# Access Virtual Chef-Level Tools & Kitchens\nEnter beautifully designed virtual kitchens with all the tools and ingredients you need.\n\n{1309596630232758}\n\n# Interactive Learning\nCook with renowned chefs and receive real-time guidance as you complete each step, with feedback on your technique and adjustments based on your skill level.\n\n{796904005958811}\n\n# Food Stories\nLearn the history, traditions, and stories behind the dishes from chefs who are excited to share their culture, making the experience richer and more meaningful.\n\n{1352874509481766}", "short_description": "Learn to cook with chefs from around the world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.potluckxr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kindred XR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.potluckxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9285063071543587"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"